            <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
            <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="                                                                                 Age Group: Teenagers (14&#x2013;17 yrs)&#xa;                                                                                Recommended Sleep: 8&#x2013;10 hours&#xa;                                                                                Ideal Sleep Time: 10:30 PM &#x2013; 7:30 AM&#xa;                                                                                                                &#xa; Tips &amp; Suggestions:&#xa; &#xa; 1.Aim to get 8-10 hours of sleep every night.&#xa;         =&gt;Adequate sleep is essential for physical and mental development during teenage years.&#xa;&#xa;2.Maintain a consistent sleep schedule.&#xa;       =&gt;Going to bed and waking up at the same time daily helps regulate your body&#x2019;s internal clock.&#xa;&#xa;3.Avoid screens (phone, TV, computer) at least 1 hour before bedtime.&#xa;       =&gt;Blue light from screens can reduce melatonin production and disrupt sleep.&#xa;&#xa;4.Avoid caffeine in the afternoon and evening.&#xa;      =&gt;Drinks like coffee, tea, or energy drinks can interfere with falling asleep.&#xa;&#xa;5.Have a light and timely dinner.&#xa;      =&gt;Heavy meals late at night can cause discomfort and affect sleep quality.&#xa;&#xa;6.Limit late-night gaming or phone use.&#xa;&#xa;7.Get at least 30 minutes of exercise daily.&#xa;      =&gt;Regular physical activity helps improve sleep quality and reduce stress.&#xa;&#xa;8.Practice relaxation or meditation before bed.&#xa;     =&gt;This helps to reduce stress and prepare your body for restful sleep."/>
          </Properties>
        </Component>
      </SubComponents>
    </Container>
